### Smart Aquarium - REST API & WebSocket Test Requests
### Panduan:
### 1. Jalankan request Register (untuk akun klien) atau Login (untuk admin/klien) guna mendapatkan JWT token.
### 2. Salin token dari respon ke variabel @token atau @adminToken di bawah.
### 3. Gunakan request lainnya sesuai hak akses token tersebut.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = tempel_token_klien_di_sini
@adminToken = tempel_token_admin_di_sini
@nodeId = aq-sim001
@claimCode = A1B2C3D4

### 1. Health Check (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Register Akun Klien Baru (Publik)
# Username: 3-32 karakter (a-z, 0-9, _, ., -), Password: minimal 8 karakter.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi",
  "password": "ganti_password_klien"
}

###

### 3. Login (Publik - Admin atau Klien)
# Ganti username dan password sesuai akun klien atau ADMIN_USERNAME & ADMIN_PASSWORD dari .env
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "ganti_dengan_ADMIN_PASSWORD"
}

###

### 4. Profil Pengguna Saat Ini (Me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Perbarui Telegram Chat ID Pengguna
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/telegram
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "telegram_chat_id": "123456789"
}

###

### 6. Klaim Kepemilikan Node (Khusus Klien)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "node_id": "{{nodeId}}",
  "claim_code": "{{claimCode}}"
}

###

### 7. Daftar Node Milik Klien (Summary)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Detail Node Milik Klien
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Ubah Nama Node (Rename)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Akuarium Ruang Tamu"
}

###

### 10. Riwayat Telemetry (Rentang Waktu ISO 8601 UTC)
# Rentang <= 48 jam mengembalikan data mentah.
# Rentang > 48 jam mengembalikan data rata-rata per jam via date_bin.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}/telemetry?from=2026-11-06T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-08T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Ubah Mode Pengoperasian Node ('auto' atau 'manual')
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "manual"
}

###

### 12. Kendali Aktuator Manual (Hanya Diizinkan Pada Mode Manual)
# Mengembalikan 202 Accepted jika berhasil, atau 409 Conflict jika mode Auto.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}/actuators
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heater": 0,
  "fan": 1,
  "pump": 0
}

###

### 13. Log Riwayat Aktuator dan Alert
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 14. Lepas Kepemilikan Node oleh Klien
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 15. [ADMIN] Daftar Seluruh Node beserta Kode Klaim
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/nodes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 16. [ADMIN] Daftarkan Node Baru
# Format node_id: ^aq-[0-9a-f]{6}$ atau ^aq-sim[0-9]{3}$
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/nodes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "node_id": "aq-1a2b3c"
}

###

### 17. [ADMIN] Buat Ulang Kode Klaim Node
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/nodes/{{nodeId}}/claim-code
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 18. [ADMIN] Lepas Kepemilikan Node Klien
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/nodes/{{nodeId}}/owner
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 19. [ADMIN] Hapus Node Beserta Seluruh Datanya (Cascade)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/nodes/{{nodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 20. WebSocket Connection (Browser / WS Client)
# Gunakan query param token:
# ws://localhost:8080/ws?token={{token}}
